{"text":"purananuru","n":277,"lines":["மீன்உண் கொக்கின் தூவிஅன்ன","வால்நரைக் கூந்தல் முதியோள் சிறுவன்","களிறுஎறிந்து பட்டனன் என்னும் உவகை","ஈன்ற ஞான்றினும் பெரிதே கண்ணீர்","நோன்கழை துயல்வரும் வெதிரத்து","வான்பெயத் தூங்கிய சிதரினும் பலவே"],"tr":["mīṉuṇ kokkiṉ tūviaṉṉa","vālnaraik kūntal mutiyōḷ ciṟuvaṉ","kaḷiṟueṟintu paṭṭaṉaṉ eṉṉum uvakai","īṉṟa ñāṉṟiṉum peritē kaṇṇīr","nōṉkaḻai tuyalvarum vetirattu","vāṉpeyat tūṅkiya citariṉum palavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"உவகைக் கலுழ்ச்சி","poet_ta":"பூங்கணுத்திரையார்","poet_tr":"Pūṅkaṇuttiraiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"6 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 24"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மீனுண்","tr":"mīṉuṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மீ","tr":"mī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னுண்","tr":"ṉuṇ"}]},{"text":"கொக்கின்","tr":"kokkiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொக்","tr":"kok"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"}]},{"text":"தூவி","tr":"tūvi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"யன்ன","tr":"yaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]}],[{"text":"வால்நரைக்","tr":"vālnaraik","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வால்","tr":"vāl"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நரைக்","tr":"naraik"}]},{"text":"கூந்தல்","tr":"kūntal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூந்","tr":"kūn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தல்","tr":"tal"}]},{"text":"முதியோள்","tr":"mutiyōḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முதி","tr":"muti"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோள்","tr":"yōḷ"}]},{"text":"சிறுவன்","tr":"ciṟuvaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"களிறெறிந்","tr":"kaḷiṟeṟin","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"களி","tr":"kaḷi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றெறிந்","tr":"ṟeṟin"}]},{"text":"துபட்டன","tr":"tupaṭṭaṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துபட்","tr":"tupaṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டன","tr":"ṭaṉa"}]},{"text":"னென்னு","tr":"ṉeṉṉu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னென்","tr":"ṉeṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னு","tr":"ṉu"}]},{"text":"முவகை","tr":"muvakai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முவ","tr":"muva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]}],[{"text":"யீன்ற","tr":"yīṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யீன்","tr":"yīṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"ஞான்றினும்","tr":"ñāṉṟiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஞான்","tr":"ñāṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினும்","tr":"ṟiṉum"}]},{"text":"பெரிதே","tr":"peritē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரி","tr":"peri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]},{"text":"கண்ணீர்","tr":"kaṇṇīr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணீர்","tr":"ṇīr"}]}],[{"text":"நோன்கழை","tr":"nōṉkaḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோன்","tr":"nōṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழை","tr":"kaḻai"}]},{"text":"துயல்வ","tr":"tuyalva","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துயல்","tr":"tuyal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"ரும்வெ","tr":"rumve","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெ","tr":"ve"}]},{"text":"திரத்து","tr":"tirattu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரத்","tr":"tirat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"வான்பெயத்","tr":"vāṉpeyat","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வான்","tr":"vāṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெயத்","tr":"peyat"}]},{"text":"தூங்கிய","tr":"tūṅkiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூங்","tr":"tūṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"சிதரினும்","tr":"citariṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சித","tr":"cita"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரினும்","tr":"riṉum"}]},{"text":"பலவே","tr":"palavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மீன்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"mīṉ","gloss":"fish"}],"gloss":"fish"},{"surface":"உண்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"uṇ","gloss":"eat"}],"gloss":"eating"},{"surface":"கொக்கின்","parts":[{"text":"கொக்கு","lemma":"kokku","gloss":"heron"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of (genitive suffix)"}],"gloss":"of the heron"},{"surface":"தூவி","parts":[{"text":"தூவி","lemma":"tūvi","gloss":"feather"}],"gloss":"feather"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வால்","parts":[{"text":"வால்","lemma":"vāl","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"நரை","parts":[{"text":"நரை","lemma":"narai","gloss":"grey hair"}],"gloss":"grey hair"},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"kūntal","gloss":"tresses"}],"gloss":"tresses"},{"surface":"முதியோள்","parts":[{"text":"முதியோள்","lemma":"முதியோள்","gloss":"old woman"}],"gloss":"old woman","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுவன்","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"small/young"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he (pronominal suffix)"}],"gloss":"son"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களிறு","parts":[{"text":"களிறு","lemma":"kaḷiṟu","gloss":"male elephant"}],"gloss":"male elephant"},{"surface":"எறிந்து","parts":[{"text":"எறிந்து","lemma":"எறிந்து","gloss":"having struck"}],"gloss":"having struck","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பட்டனன்","parts":[{"text":"பட்டனன்","lemma":"பட்டனன்","gloss":"he fell"}],"gloss":"he fell","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்னும்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"say"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"உவகை","parts":[{"text":"உவகை","lemma":"uvakai","gloss":"joy"}],"gloss":"joy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈன்ற","parts":[{"text":"ஈன்","lemma":"īṉ","gloss":"give birth"},{"text":"ற","lemma":"ṟa","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"gave birth"},{"surface":"ஞான்றினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஞான்று","lemma":"ñāṉṟu","gloss":"time/day"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"comparative suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/more than"}],"gloss":"more than the day"},{"surface":"பெரிதே","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"peritu","gloss":"great thing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is indeed greater"},{"surface":"கண்ணீர்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"tears"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோன்","parts":[{"text":"நோன்","lemma":"nōṉ","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"கழை","parts":[{"text":"கழை","lemma":"kaḻai","gloss":"bamboo"}],"gloss":"bamboo"},{"surface":"துயல்வரும்","parts":[{"text":"துயல்","lemma":"tuyal","gloss":"sway"},{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"varum","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"swaying"},{"surface":"வெதிரத்து","parts":[{"text":"வெதிரத்து","lemma":"வெதிரத்து","gloss":"of the bamboo"}],"gloss":"of the bamboo","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான்","parts":[{"text":"வான்","lemma":"vāṉ","gloss":"sky/rain"}],"gloss":"sky/rain"},{"surface":"பெய","parts":[{"text":"பெய்","lemma":"pey","gloss":"pour/rain"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to rain"},{"surface":"தூங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"tūṅku","gloss":"hang/suspend"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"iya","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"hung"},{"surface":"சிதரினும்","parts":[{"text":"சிதர்","lemma":"citar","gloss":"raindrop"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"comparative suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/more than"}],"gloss":"more than the drops"},{"surface":"பலவே","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"pala","gloss":"many"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"are indeed many"}]}],"literal":"Like the feathers of a fish-eating heron / the old woman with pure white grey hair, her son / having struck down a male elephant, died, saying so, the joy / was greater than the day she gave birth to him; her tears / on the strong-stalked swaying bamboo / than the drops suspended when the sky rained, are indeed many.","translation":"The joy of the old woman, whose hair is as white as the feathers of a fish-eating heron, upon hearing that her son fell in battle after slaying a war elephant, was even greater than the day she gave birth to him. Yet, her tears of pride and grief are more numerous than the raindrops clinging to the swaying stalks of strong bamboo after a downpour.","modern":"மீனை உண்ணும் கொக்கின் இறகைப் போன்ற தூய நரைமுடியைக் கொண்ட முதியவளின் மகன், போர்க்களத்தில் ஆண் யானையை வீழ்த்தித் தானும் மடிந்தான் என்ற செய்தியைக் கேட்டபோது அவளுக்கு ஏற்பட்ட மகிழ்ச்சி, அவனைப் பெற்றெடுத்த நாளில் அடைந்த மகிழ்ச்சியை விடப் பெரியதாகும். அவளது கண்களிலிருந்து பெருகிய கண்ணீர்த்துளிகள், பலத்த மூங்கில் காடுகளில் மழை பெய்த பிறகு அசையும் மூங்கில் கணுக்களில் தங்கியிருக்கும் நீர்த்துளிகளை விடப் பலவாகும்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the tumpai tiṇai, which deals with battle and heroic deeds, and specifically illustrates the theme of uvakaik kaluḻcci, or weeping out of overwhelming joy and pride. The poet Pūṅkaṇuttiraiyār describes an aged mother whose hair is as white as the feathers of a fish-eating heron. When she hears that her son died heroically on the battlefield after slaying an enemy war elephant, she is filled with a pride that surpasses the joy of the day he was born. However, her maternal grief and pride manifest as tears that flow uncontrollably. The poet compares her tears to the countless water droplets clinging to and falling from swaying bamboo stalks after a heavy rain, beautifully capturing the complex mixture of sorrow and triumph.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,5.0],[5.0,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.9],[6.9,7.0],[7.0,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,9.84],[9.84,10.13],[10.13,10.13],[10.13,10.13],[10.13,10.13],[10.13,11.0],[11.0,12.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,5.2],[5.2,6.0],[6.0,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,7.4],[7.4,7.5],[7.5,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,9.99],[9.99,9.99],[9.99,10.57],[10.84,11.93],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.6]]},"sync":[[["மீன்","fish"],["உண்","eating"]],[["கொக்கின்","of the heron"]],[["தூவி","feather"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["வால்","white"],["நரை","grey hair"]],[["கூந்தல்","tresses"]],[["முதியோள்","old woman"]],[["சிறுவன்","son"]],[["களிறு","male elephant"],["எறிந்து","having struck"]],[["பட்டனன்","he fell"]],[["என்னும்","saying"]],[["உவகை","joy"]],[["ஈன்ற","gave birth"]],[["ஞான்றினும்","more than the day"]],[["பெரிதே","is indeed greater"]],[["கண்ணீர்","tears"]],[["நோன்","strong"],["கழை","bamboo"]],[["துயல்வரும்","swaying"]],[["வெதிரத்து","of the bamboo"]],[["வான்","sky/rain"],["பெய","to rain"]],[["தூங்கிய","hung"]],[["சிதரினும்","more than the drops"]],[["பலவே","are indeed many"]]]}